{"id":"wb-5-345","name":"南阳知府衙门","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南阳知府衙门","text":"南阳知府衙门（通常称为“南阳府衙”或者“南阳府署”）位于河南省南阳市宛城区民主街100号。是元、明、清三代南阳知府的官署。现存房屋150余间，南北长240米，东西宽150米，面积36000平方米，是中国惟一保存完整、规制完备的知府衙门。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E9%98%B3%E7%9F%A5%E5%BA%9C%E8%A1%99%E9%97%A8","revisionId":94444029,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94444029","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1d107419404ea1bbe4e578ba.jpg","title":"20260904_Nanyang_Fu_Yamen_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260904_Nanyang_Fu_Yamen_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/20260904_Nanyang_Fu_Yamen_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南南阳 南阳知府衙门","width":320,"height":213}}